Package: ellmercodex
Title: Experimental Codex Integration for 'ellmer'
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Simon", "Herrera", email = "simxnherrera@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Simon Herrera [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Simon Herrera <simxnherrera@gmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/simxnherrera/ellmercodex
BugReports: https://github.com/simxnherrera/ellmercodex/issues
Description: Connects 'ellmer' text chats to observed subscription-backed
    'Codex' authentication and streaming response behavior. Provides explicit
    browser sign-in, package-scoped credential storage, redacted diagnostics,
    multi-turn text and structured-output chat, account-specific model
    discovery, and reasoning-effort selection. This independent third-party
    integration uses an undocumented compatibility transport, is not endorsed
    by OpenAI, and may
    stop working without notice.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
